    directive: "Write a sentence using the coordinating conjunction 'denn' to express cause, with main-clause word order in both clauses and no fronting of the causal clause, e.g. 'Er blieb zu Hause, denn er war krank.'",
    share: 1,
  },
  {
    id: "adverbial-deshalb-daher-folglich",
